Astronomy code moved out (August 2026)
--------------------------------------
The prehistoric-astronomy programs now live in their own repository,
inti-huatana/prehistoric-astronomy, together with a book of their own.
Only stellar_calendar.py and stellar_calendar_latex.py stayed here,
because they build this book's appendix tables and nothing else uses them.
Both are self-contained: they import only numpy and pandas.
